# hush repository visibility and local generated files.
# Keep the runtime, the shipped voice, tests and public documentation visible.

# Private working material and documentation
.private/
docs/tasks/
docs/decisions/
docs/knowledge/private/
docs/apis/private/

# Machine-local agent state; shared instructions stay visible
**/.claude/settings.local.json
**/.claude/memory/
CLAUDE.local.md
AGENTS.override.md

# Style-slot state written at run time by /hush:pick-style, never published
/output-styles/hush.md.stock
/output-styles/hush.md.active.json

# Plugin-local session state written at run time, never published
.assay/
.foreman/
.scribe/

# Dependency cache and operating-system metadata
node_modules/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
